    {
      "source": "Convenient subclass of Spring's standard <a href=\"../../export/MBeanExporter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\"><code>MBeanExporter</code></a>,\nactivating annotation usage for JMX exposure of Spring beans:\n<a href=\"../../export/annotation/ManagedResource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>ManagedResource</code></a>, <a href=\"../../export/annotation/ManagedAttribute.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>ManagedAttribute</code></a>, <a href=\"../../export/annotation/ManagedOperation.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>ManagedOperation</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "Spring 标准 `<a href=\"../../export/MBeanExporter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\"><code>MBeanExporter</code></a>` 的便捷子类，用于激活注解以暴露 Spring Bean 到 JMX：`<a href=\"../../export/annotation/ManagedResource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>ManagedResource</code></a>`、`<a href=\"../../export/annotation/ManagedAttribute.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>ManagedAttribute</code></a>`、`<a href=\"../../export/annotation/ManagedOperation.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>ManagedOperation</code></a>` 等。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> that creates a JSR-160 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/remote/JMXConnectorServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.remote\"><code>JMXConnectorServer</code></a>,\noptionally registers it with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/MBeanServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>MBeanServer</code></a>, and then starts it.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> 用于创建 JSR-160 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/remote/JMXConnectorServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.remote\"><code>JMXConnectorServer</code></a>，\n可选地将其注册到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/MBeanServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>MBeanServer</code></a>，然后启动它。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Uses of <a href=\"../MBeanRegistrationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.support\">MBeanRegistrationSupport</a> in <a href=\"../../export/package-summary.html\">org.springframework.jmx.export</a>",
      "translation": "`MBeanRegistrationSupport` 类在 `org.springframework.jmx.export` 包中的用法",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Uses of <a href=\"../MBeanRegistrationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.support\">MBeanRegistrationSupport</a> in <a href=\"../../export/annotation/package-summary.html\">org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation</a>",
      "translation": "`MBeanRegistrationSupport` 在 `org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation` 中的用法",
      "count": 2
