    {
      "source": "Uses of <a href=\"../MBeanRegistrationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.support\">MBeanRegistrationSupport</a> in <a href=\"../package-summary.html\">org.springframework.jmx.support</a>",
      "translation": "`MBeanRegistrationSupport` 类在 `org.springframework.jmx.support` 包中的用法",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "JMX exporter that allows for exposing any <i>Spring-managed bean</i> to a\nJMX <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/MBeanServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>MBeanServer</code></a>, without the need to define any\nJMX-specific information in the bean classes.",
      "translation": "允许将任何<i>Spring 管理的 Bean</i>暴露给 JMX <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/MBeanServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>MBeanServer</code></a>，而无需在 Bean 类中定义任何特定的 JMX 信息。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Contains support classes for connecting to local and remote <code>MBeanServer</code>s\nand for exposing an <code>MBeanServer</code> to remote clients.",
      "translation": "包含用于连接到本地和远程 `<code>MBeanServer</code>` 以及向远程客户端暴露 `<code>MBeanServer</code>` 的支持类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This package provides declarative creation and registration of\nSpring-managed beans as JMX MBeans.",
      "translation": "该包提供对 Spring 管理的 Bean 作为 JMX MBean 进行声明式创建和注册。",
      "count": 1
